    "background_story": "Mira was a skilled actress, but her greatest role was pretending to be ill. She had a knack for feigning symptoms, convincing even the most skeptical doctors of her ailments. Her friends and family grew tired of her constant complaints, but Mira couldn't resist the attention and sympathy that came with being sick. She would often call in sick to work, only to be spotted at the mall or beach on the same day. Her employers were fed up with her antics, and her relationships began to suffer. Despite her talent for deception, Mira's life was a mess of half-truths and fabricated illnesses. She became isolated, and her reputation as a malingerer preceded her. It seemed that Mira's greatest performance was convincing everyone that she was sicker than she actually was.",
